<section id="work">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">06</span> Selected Work <span class="line"></span></p>
  <h2 class="lede"><span class="marker"></span>Engagements where the workflow earned its keep.</h2>

  <div class="cs-list">

    <article class="item">
      <div class="cs-imgslot">[ case study screenshot ]</div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="num">/ 01</span>
        <div class="cs-tag">CASE STUDY &middot; 01 &mdash; FINTECH</div>
        <h3 class="cs-h">Compliance-grade agentic review for a tier-1 bank</h3>
        <p class="cs-p">A trading-floor compliance team buried in document review. Built a small graph of specialist agents with a rollback-by-default policy, a typed audit trail, and a human review gate on every write. Survived audit. Still in production.</p>
        <div class="metric-wrap">
          <div class="cs-metric">
            <div><span class="v">8&times;</span><span class="k">review throughput</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">100%</span><span class="k">audit trail</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">0</span><span class="k">false-ship</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="arr">↗</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="item">
      <div class="cs-imgslot">[ case study screenshot ]</div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="num">/ 02</span>
        <div class="cs-tag">CASE STUDY &middot; 02 &mdash; WEB3 INFRA</div>
        <h3 class="cs-h">Filecoin / IPFS pipeline with an agent ops layer</h3>
        <p class="cs-p">Storage clients with petabyte-scale deal flow needed monitoring, retrieval verification, and remediation that didn&rsquo;t require a human on every alert. Drawing on Protocol Labs work, we shipped an agent ops layer that handles the boring 95% &mdash; humans handle the rest.</p>
        <div class="metric-wrap">
          <div class="cs-metric">
            <div><span class="v">PB-scale</span><span class="k">deals managed</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">&minus;70%</span><span class="k">on-call load</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">99.9%</span><span class="k">retrieval SLA</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="arr">↗</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="item">
      <div class="cs-imgslot">[ case study screenshot ]</div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="num">/ 03</span>
        <div class="cs-tag">CASE STUDY &middot; 03 &mdash; ENTERPRISE</div>
        <h3 class="cs-h">Migrating a Fortune-100 chatbot to a multi-agent assistant</h3>
        <p class="cs-p">Took a single-prompt support bot and decomposed it into specialist agents with typed tools, a router, and a golden eval set built from real historical tickets. Quality, cost, and latency moved the right direction at once. Rare combo.</p>
        <div class="metric-wrap">
          <div class="cs-metric">
            <div><span class="v">2.4&times;</span><span class="k">resolution rate</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">&minus;38%</span><span class="k">cost / session</span></div>
            <div><span class="v">p95 &minus;1.1s</span><span class="k">latency</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="arr">↗</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="item">
      <div class="cs-imgslot">[ &larr; placeholder &mdash; your engagement here ]</div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="num">/ 04</span>
        <div class="cs-tag">NEXT &middot; YOUR PROJECT</div>
        <h3 class="cs-h">Your production system here.</h3>
        <p class="cs-p">If your team is between &ldquo;we played with an LLM&rdquo; and &ldquo;we&rsquo;re running it in production with our eyes open&rdquo; &mdash; that&rsquo;s the gap AR Data closes. Send a brief; let&rsquo;s scope it.</p>
        <div class="metric-wrap">
          <div class="cs-metric">
            <div><span class="v">→</span><span class="k">discovery call</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="arr">↗</span>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ── Shared base rules ── */
  .cs-list .item {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: transform .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;
  }
  .cs-list .item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

  .cs-imgslot {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,
        color-mix(in oklch, var(--rule) 60%, var(--paper)) 0 1px,
        transparent 1px 12px),
      var(--paper-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cs-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .cs-h {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .cs-p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cs-metric {
    display: flex; gap: 28px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .cs-metric div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .cs-metric .v { font-size: 22px; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--serif); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .cs-metric .k { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── Spotlight layout (unconditional) ── */
  .cs-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  /* First item: large 2-col */
  .cs-list .item:first-child {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cs-list .item:first-child .cs-imgslot {
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    min-height: 100%;
  }
  .cs-list .item:first-child .body {
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;
  }
  .cs-list .item:first-child .cs-h {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 44px);
  }
  .cs-list .item:first-child .metric-wrap {
    margin-top: auto; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  /* Items 2–4: compact horizontal rows */
  .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr auto;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .cs-imgslot {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-bottom: none; border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .body {
    padding: 18px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
  }
  .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .metric-wrap {
    padding-right: 24px;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .cs-list .item:first-child { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cs-list .item:first-child .cs-imgslot { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
    .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .cs-imgslot { aspect-ratio: 16/10; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .body { padding: 18px; }
    .cs-list .item:not(:first-child) .metric-wrap { padding: 0 18px 18px; }
  }
</style>
